ogs":[{"nodeId":706930101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1472780842,"text":"わたしたちにはお見通しなんだから！","nextNodeIds":[706930102]},{"nodeId":706930102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1354033946,"text":"エウルアが一番嫌いなのはきっと…眉間に堅苦しさと古臭さを刻んでる、とにかく細かくて、こだわりが強くて、手順とかで煩わせてくるような人！","nextNodeIds":[706930103]},{"nodeId":706930103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":3334396570,"text":"ああ…片眼鏡をかけて、手にはいつも本を持っているような、な。だが実は、その本はただの飾りで、実際に読んだわけじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[706930104]},{"nodeId":706930104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":3388357474,"text":"ただ、持っていれば「知識人」のような雰囲気が出て、会話の始めから相手を気迫で圧倒できると思っているんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706930105]},{"nodeId":706930105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3854874018,"text":"ふふっ！的確すぎ！頭の中にもう絵が浮かんじゃった！","nextNodeIds":[706930106]},{"nodeId":706930106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1299119786,"text":"煙緋と…アンバー？珍しい組み合わせだな！","nextNodeIds":[706930107,706930108]},{"nodeId":706930107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1777608738,"text":"何の話をしてるの？","nextNodeIds":[706930109]},{"nodeId":706930109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3423601610,"text":"あっ、旅人とパイモン！来てたんだね！","nextNodeIds":[706930110]},{"nodeId":706930110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3961191210,"text":"「悪者雪だるま」を遊芸の隠し要素として加えてみようかって、煙緋と相談してたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706930111]},{"nodeId":706930111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4167339882,"text":"魔物の的…みたいなもんか？","nextNodeIds":[706930112]},{"nodeId":706930112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1738356114,"text":"うん。でも、定番悪役の魔物以外にも、もっと型破りなキャラクターを入れてもいいと思ったんだよね。","nextNodeIds":[706930113]},{"nodeId":706930113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2910971714,"text":"そのキャラクター決めの方向性で、煙緋と意見がピッタリ合っちゃって！","nextNodeIds":[706930114,706930115]},{"nodeId":706930114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3585301090,"text":"こんなところで煙緋に会えるなんて。","nextNodeIds":[706930116]},{"nodeId":706930116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":530824378,"text":"なんかすごいな。すっごく相性がよさそうだって、見てるだけでわかるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[706930117]},{"nodeId":706930117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":3093758426,"text":"#ああ、モンドで{NICKNAME}とパイモンに会えるなんて、驚いたぞ！","nextNodeIds":[706930118]},{"nodeId":706930118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":1169857370,"text":"実は、私もモンドに来るのは初めてじゃないんだ。前にも民事訴訟の処理を手伝ったことが何回かあってな…","nextNodeIds":[706930119]},{"nodeId":706930119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":4216347898,"text":"今回は、ヨォーヨとの仕事を終えたところで、ちょうど「ドラゴンスパイン国際クロスカントリー大会」の開幕に出くわして、せっかく楽しんでいこうと思ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706930120]},{"nodeId":706930120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":2717042154,"text":"それで、会場で道を尋ねたら、偶然アンバーと出会って…それがまた、すごく気が合ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706930121]},{"nodeId":706930121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":2664549434,"text":"だからアンバーの担当している遊びを体験するついでに、改善の手伝いをしているというわけだ。","nextNodeIds":[706930122]},{"nodeId":706930122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1703285890,"text":"へへっ、エウルアの友達は私の友達だもん。面白いゲームは一緒に楽しまないとね！","nextNodeIds":[706930123]},{"nodeId":706930123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":804166474,"text":"栄誉騎士とパイモンも試してみない？各国のゲストに馴染んでもらうための、ストレス発散ミニゲーム——「雪玉チャレンジ」だよ。","nextNodeIds":[706930124]},{"nodeId":706930124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1365398402,"text":"おう！雪合戦の腕を磨いとくのも悪くないな！いつか役に立つかもしれないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[706930125]},{"nodeId":706930125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2434478514,"text":"#それから、{NICKNAME}と暇な時に勝負して、負けた方が料理を作るっていうのもありだぜ！","nextNodeIds":[706930126,706930127]},{"nodeId":706930126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1070419970,"text":"それは見逃せないね。","nextNodeIds":[706930128]},{"nodeId":706930128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2221167426,"text":"雪玉を投げるのも、炎弾を投げるのも…元素の投擲には、共通点があるもんね！","nextNodeIds":[706930129]},{"nodeId":706930129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30895,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":1558560210,"text":"お前のような武芸の天才にとっては、お手の物だろう！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706930127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1655105626,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}、雪玉投げには自信あるよ。","nextNodeIds":[706930128]},{"nodeId":706930115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2974241354,"text":"二人が一緒にいるのは想像できなかったな。","nextNodeIds":[706930116]},{"nodeId":706930108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":690064418,"text":"エウルアの嫌いな人のこと？","nextNodeIds":[706930109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7069301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30895"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7069301],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType